 that allows the user to specify certain installation settings and options, such as which components will be installed.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="41721">custom install</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="474874">ಗ್ರಾಹಕೀಯ ಸ್ಥಾಪಿಸುವಿಕೆ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="11936_23875_473331"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The amount of light that is emitted by a computer monitor or picture displayed on the monitor.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="23875">brightness</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="473331">ಪ್ರಕಾಶಮಾನ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="11940_298006_1903178"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The application that is used to open an attachment for Attachment Previewing.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="298006">Attachment Previewer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1903178">ಲಗತ್ತಿನ ಪೂರ್ವವೀಕ್ಷಕ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="11947_65138_473652"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In an environment capable of displaying multiple on-screen windows, any window other than the one currently being used for work. An inactive window can be partially or entirely hidden behind another window, and it remains inactive until the user selects it.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="65138">inactive window</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="473652">ನಿಷ್ಕ್ರಿಯ ವಿಂಡೋ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="11961_180264_2855529"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A trust relationship between two or more SIP domains that permits users in separate organizations to communicate in real time across network boundaries.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="180264">federation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2855529">ಒಕ್ಕೂಟ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="11968_1089155_474916"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The &amp; character.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1089155">&amp;</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected<