ed to that automatically sets the appropriate firewall settings for the location.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="145137">network location</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2785853">ನೆಟ್‌‌‌ವರ್ಕ್ ಸ್ಥಳ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14210_2307008_2770800"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The act of reducing the probability and/or impact of a risk to an acceptable level.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2307008">mitigation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2770800">ಉಪಶಮನ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14210_252102_2770800"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The act of reducing the probability and/or impact of a risk to an acceptable level.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="252102">risk mitigation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2770800">ಉಪಶಮನ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14211_213519_2641119"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An order for a SKU that is currently not available for delivery.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="213519">pre-order</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2641119">ಮುಂಚಿತವಾಗಿ ಆರ್ಡರ್ ಮಾಡಿ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14212_338602_2198115"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The status message displayed for the current network when a user changes the network selection to something other than the network of the main provider.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="338602">Home service</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2198115">ಹೋಮ್ ವಿಳಾಸ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14216_397178_1956737"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A group of recipients that are created to expedite the mass emailing of messages and other information. When email is sent to a mail-enabled universal distribution group, all members of that list receive a copy of the message. Mail-enabled universal distribution groups cannot be used to assign permissions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="397178">mail-enabled universal distribution 