enables users to automatically perform routine tasks on a chosen computer by monitoring whatever criteria the users choose to initiate the tasks (referred to as triggers) and then executing the tasks when the criteria is met.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="307402">Task Scheduler</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="474785">ಕಾರ್ಯ ನಿಗದಿ ಪಟ್ಟಿ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14695_374338_1793088"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A field data type that can contain up to 255 characters or the number of characters specified by the Fieldsize property, whichever is less.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="374338">Text</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1793088">ಪಠ್ಯ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="14697_63563_2198123"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Microsoft Windows technology that provides home and small-office computer users who have networked computers with the ability to share a single connection to the Internet.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="63563">ICS</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><ter