ircuit board in a computer that contains most of the basic components of the system.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="81654">system board</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2485764">ಬೇಸ್‌ಬೋರ್ಡ್</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15384_178508_2344815"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An order for a large quantity of products or services. The minimum quantity that qualifies as a bulk order is set by individual companies.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="178508">bulk order</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2344815">ದೊಡ್ಡ ಪ್ರಮಾಣದ ಆರ್ಡರ್</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15386_154964_474231"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A delay of the amount of time that elapses before a character begins repeating when you hold down a key.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="154964">repeat delay</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="474231">ಪುನರಾವರ್ತನೆ ವಿಳಂಬ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</term