o access the data in that component.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="650879">identifier</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1793048">ಗುರುತಿಸುವಿಕೆ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="18529_650883_1251092"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Data that is stored outside of the application that is currently in use.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="650883">external data</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1251092">ಬಾಹ್ಯಾ ದತ್ತ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="18529_650883_1308125"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Data that is stored outside of the application that is currently in use.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="650883">external data</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1308125">ಬಾಹ್ಯ ಡೇಟಾ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="18530_650884_1251093"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A range of data that is brought into a worksheet but that originates outside of Excel, such as in a database or text file.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="650884">external data range</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1251093">ಬಾಹ್ಯಾ ದತ್ತ ಶ್ರೇಣಿ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="18530_650884_1308126"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A range of data that is brought into a worksheet but that originates outside of Excel, such as in a database or text file.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="650884">external data range</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1308126">ಬಾಹ್ಯ ಡೇಟಾ ಶ್ರೇಣಿ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="18535_650889_1903259"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A pane located on top of the Navigation Pane that has copies of your Inbox, Sent Items, and so on. You can add, remove, and arrange folders in this pane. Collapse or expand the pane by clicking the arrow in the Favorite Folders header.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="650889">Favorite Folders</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1903259">ಮೆಚ್ಚಿನ ಫೋಲ್ಡರ್‌ಗಳು</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="18536_650890_1251094"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A button that identifies a field in a PivotTable or PivotChart report. You can drag the field buttons to change the layout of the report, or click the arrows next to the buttons to change the level of detail displayed in the report.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="650890">field button</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1251094">ಕ್ಷೇತ್ರದ ಗುಂಡಿ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="18536_650890_1308127"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A button that identifies a field in a PivotTable or PivotChart report. You can drag the field buttons to change the layout of the report, or click the arrows next to the buttons to change the level of detail displayed in the report.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="650890">field button</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1308127">ಕ್ಷೇತ್ರದ ಬಟನ್</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="18538_650892_1251095"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The part of PivotTable or PivotChart view that contains filter fields.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="650892">filter area</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1251095">ಫಿಲ್ಟರ್ ವಿಸ್ತೀರ್ಣ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="18538_650892_1308128"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The part of PivotTable or PivotChart view that contains filter fields.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="650892">filter area</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1308128">ಫಿಲ್ಟರ್ ಪ್ರದೇಶ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="18539_650893_1251096"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A field in the filter area that you can use to filter data displayed in PivotTable or PivotChart view. Filter fields perform the same functions as page fields in Microsoft Excel PivotTable reports.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="650893">filter field</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1251096">ಫಿಲ್ಟರ್ ಕ್ಷೇತ್ರ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="18542_650896_1423593"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The date that a project or task is scheduled to be completed. This date is based on the task's start date, duration, calendars, predecessor dates, task dependencies, and constraints.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="650896">finish date</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1423593">ಪೂರ್ಣಗೊಳ್ಳುವ ದಿನಾಂಕ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="18549_650903_1251097"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An Internet Web page or intranet page that is associated with an Outlook folder. If a page has been associated with the folder and the option is set, the Web page appears in the Outlook window whenever you select the folder.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="650903">folder home page</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1251097">ಹೋಲ್ಡರ್ ನ ಹೋಂ ಪುಟ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="18549_650903_1308129"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An Internet Web page or intranet page that is associated with an Outlook folder. If a page has been associated with the folder and the option is set, the Web page appears in the Outlook window whenever you select the folder.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="650903">folder home page</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1308129">ಫೋಲ್ಡರ್‌ನ ಮುಖ ಪುಟ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1855_307383_1319322"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The process of validating software with the manufacturer. Activation confirms the genuine status of a product and that the product key has not been compromised. It establishes a relationship between the software’s product key and a particular installation of that software on a device.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="307383">activation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1319322">ಕ್ರಿಯಾತ್ಮಕಗೊಳಿಸುವಿಕೆ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="18551_650905_1251098"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A location on a computer's hard drive to store a local copy of a form to improve performance when opening a form subsequent times.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="650905">forms cache</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1251098">ಪ್ರಪತ್ರ ಕ್ಯಾಶ್</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="18551_650905_1308130"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A location on a computer's hard drive to store a local copy of a form to improve performance when opening a form subsequent times.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="650905">forms cache</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1308130">ಫಾರ್ಮ್‌ಗಳ ಕ್ಯಾಶ್</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="18558_650912_1251099"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A method to find a specific value for a cell by adjusting the value of one other cell. When goal seeking, Excel varies the value in a cell that you specify until a formula that's dependent on that cell returns the result you want.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="650912">goal seek</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1251099">ಗುರಿ ಹುಡುಕಾಟ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="18559_650913_1793047"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A rank or category assigned to a material resource that denotes functional use but not level of quality. A low-grade resource is not necessarily a low-quality resource.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="650913">grade</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1793047">ಗ್ರೇಡ್</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1856_52994_1902950"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Expressed as n! (n factorial), the result of multiplying the successive integers from 1 through n; n! equals n x (n - 1) x (n - 2) x ... x 1.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="52994">factorial</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1902950">ಗುಣಲಬ್ಧ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="18560_650914_1251100"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The faint vertical and horizontal lines that appear in the drawing window when the grid is turned on. You can use grid lines to help position shapes precisely.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="650914">grid lines</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</t