 character.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="128261">vertical bar</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="474031">ಪೈಪ್</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1858_128262_474030"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The | character.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="128262">VERTICAL LINE</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="474030">ಉದ್ದಪಟ್ಟಿ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1858_128262_474031"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The | character.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="128262">VERTICAL LINE</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="474031">ಪೈಪ್</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1858_128263_474030"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The | character.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="128263">pipe</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><