gallery of frequently-used actions with the touch of a button. Users can customize the gallery to execute a combination of operations in one click.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="747785">Quick Steps</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1251148">ಲಘು ಹೆಜ್ಜೆಗಳು</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20840_747989_1423626"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A frame that contains text, shapes, pictures, or other content. A slide is a digital equivalent to a traditional film slide.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="747989">slide</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1423626">ಸ್ಲೈಡ್</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20843_748066_2497092"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Windows tool used to capture a screen shot, or snip, of any object on the screen, and then annotate, save, or share the image.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="748066">Snipping Tool</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2497092">ಕತ್ತರಿಸುವಿಕೆ ಪರಿಕರ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="par