"1275648">on-premises messaging system</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1956794">ಸ್ಥಳದಲ್ಲಿನ ಸಂದೇಶ ವ್ಯವಸ್ಥೆ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26524_1275651_1956812"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An account that can receive mail using the POP3 protocol.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1275651">POP-enabled account</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1956812">POP-ಸಕ್ರಿಯಗೊಳಿಸಿದ ಖಾತೆ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26525_1275652_1956818"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The email address that appears in the E-Mail Options section of the user's mailbox in the Web management interface for Outlook Live.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1275652">primary e-mail address</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1956818">ಪ್ರಾಥಮಿಕ ಇ-ಮೇಲ್ ವಿಳಾಸ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26526_1275654_1956832"><langSe