oyment plans, and that is part of software assurance coverage.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1484852">SharePoint Deployment Planning Services</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2726362">SDPS</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28405_1484852_2726363"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The set of services designed to help evaluate organizations' environments, develop customized Microsoft SharePoint deployment plans, and that is part of software assurance coverage.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1484852">SharePoint Deployment Planning Services</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2726363">SharePoint ನಿಯೋಜನೆಯ ಯೋಜನೆ ಸೇವೆಗಳು</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28405_1673938_2726362"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The set of services designed to help evaluate organizations' environments, develop customized Microsoft SharePoint deployment plans, and that is part of software assurance coverage.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1673938">SDPS</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2726362">SDPS</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28405_1673938_2726363"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The set of services designed to help evaluate organizations' environments, develop customized Microsoft SharePoint deployment plans, and that is part of software assurance coverage.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1673938">SDPS</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2726363">SharePoint ನಿಯೋಜನೆಯ ಯೋಜನೆ ಸೇವೆಗಳು</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28406_1484854_2726353"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Software Assurance benefit delivered by Microsoft Certified Partner that consists of one to fifteen days of planning the deployment of Microsoft Office Software for a specific organization.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1484854">Microsoft Desktop Deployment Planning Services</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2726353">Microsoft ಡೆಸ್ಕ್‌ಟಾಪ್ ನಿಯೋಜನೆಯ ಯೋಜನೆ ಸೇವೆಗಳು</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28426_1486692_2688572"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An entity that represents a service at the Key Distribution Center (KDC). The service principal has a name and an associated key. A subclass of principal, a service principal generally does not correspond to a human user of the system, but rather to an automated service providing a resource, such as a file server.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1486692">service principal</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2688572">ಸೇವೆ ಪ್ರಾಮುಖ್ಯತೆ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2846_297003_474731"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A trojan that captures and/or transmits passwords to an attacker.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="297003">password stealer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="474731">ಪಾಸ್‌ವರ್ಡ್ ಸ್ಟೀಲರ್</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28462_1488403_2729637"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that allows the preservation of items in user mailboxes and the protection of the items from deletion by users or automated processes.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1488403">Litigation Hold</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2729637">ವಿವಾದದ ಹಿಡಿತ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28541_1489075_1931361"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A service under which customers can acquire and redeem points for certain online services and digital products.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1489075">Microsoft Points</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1931361">Microsoft ಅಂಶಗಳು</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28593_1489612_2074191"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A process of repeated installation of a product, feature, tool, kit, pack, etc.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1489612">reinstallation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2074191">ಮರುಸ್ಥಾಪನೆ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28619_1489914_2198344"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Pertaining to a request for payment.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1489914">billing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2198344">ಬಿಲ್ಲಿಂಗ್</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2865_19878_473304"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The special identification code printed as a set of vertical bars of differing widths on books, grocery products, and other merchandise. Used for rapid, error-free input in such facilities as libraries, hospitals, and grocery stores, bar codes represent binary information that can be read by an optical scanner. The coding can include numbers, letters, or a combination of the two; some codes include built-in error checking and can be read in either direction.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="19878">bar code</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="473304">ಬಾರ್ ಕೋಡ್</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2865_237346_473304"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The special identification code printed as a set of vertical bars of differing widths on books, grocery products, and other merchandise. Used for rapid, error-free input in such facilities as libraries, hospitals, and grocery stores, bar codes represent binary information that can be read by an optical scanner. The coding can include numbers, letters, or a combination of the two; some codes include built-in error checking and can be read in either direction.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="237346">barcode</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="473304">ಬಾರ್ ಕೋಡ್</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28691_1490094_2855536"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The offer from Microsoft Office 365 that provides a unified communications plan with advanced capabilities, including enterprise instant messaging, presence, and online meetings with audio and video conferencing and multiparty data sharing.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1490094">Lync Online (Plan 2)</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2855536">Lync ಆನ್‌ಲೈನ್ (ಯೋಜನೆ 2)</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28719_1491626_2855522"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An act that has an effect in a system.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1491626">action</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2855522">ಕ್ರಿಯೆ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="28720_1491627_2488856"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A definite magnitude of currency, a quantity of currency, or an indefinite magnitude of an uncountable substance or quality.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1491627">amount</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2488856">ಮೊತ್ತ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2874_12683_1253099"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A software technique for smoothing the jagged appearance of curved or diagonal lines caused by poor resolution on a display screen by adjusting the brightness or color of surrounding pixels.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="12683">antialiasing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1253099">ಆಂಟಿಅಲಾಯ್ಸಿಂಗ್</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2874_12683_1903509"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A software technique for smoothing the jagged appearance of curved or diagonal lines caused by poor resolution on a di