rogram window.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="47370">docked toolbar</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="473528">ಡಾಕ್ಡ್ ಪರಿಕರಪಟ್ಟಿ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38399_2223248_2232797"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Sway Design feature that allows users to change the navigation and layout model of a particular Sway document.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2223248">Structure</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2232797">ರಚನೆ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38416_2226110_2233225"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The service that is installed as part of the MultiPoint role on server and ensures that some MultiPoint configuration settings remain set to keep Windows MultiPoint Server running smoothly.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2226110">Windows MultiPoint Server Repair Service</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2233225">Windows MultiPoint Server ರಿಪೇರಿ ಸೇವೆ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun<