ditorially chosen apps and games for merchandising or marketing purposes.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2227158">Collection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2233090">ಸಂಗ್ರಹ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38421_2227159_2233094"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows the user to select a color and increase or decrease the vibrancy of that color in an image.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2227159">color boost</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2233094">ಬಣ್ಣ ಬೂಸ್ಟ್</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38422_2227160_2791321"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The menu invoked with a shortcut key (Windows + G) when gaming that allows users to take a screenshot, take a 30 second clip of a game, and adjust volume controls.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2227160">Game Bar</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2791321">Game Bar</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38423_2227161_2233127"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The platform on which the operating system runs on form factors other than PCs, tablets, and phones.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2227161">IoT</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2233127">IoT</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38423_2227161_2269486"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The platform on which the operating system runs on form factors other than PCs, tablets, and phones.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2227161">IoT</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2269486">ವಿಷಯಗಳ ಇಂಟರ್ನೆಟ್</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38423_2268355_2233127"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The platform on which the operating system runs on form factors other than PCs, tablets, and phones.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2268355">Internet of Things</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2233127">IoT</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38423_2268355_2269486"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The platform on which the operating system runs on form factors other than PCs, tablets, and phones.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2268355">Internet of Things</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2269486">ವಿಷಯಗಳ ಇಂಟರ್ನೆಟ್</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38424_2227162_2233150"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A broad set of all the user's local and cloud-based content, including documents, apps, settings, photos, videos, music, and email.  Cortana or Bing can search this content and return it in search results.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2227162">my stuff</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2233150">ನನ್ನ ಸಂಗತಿ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38426_2227164_2233188"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A note, handwritten or typed, that can be added by the user directly on webpages from within the browser.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2227164">Web Note</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2233188">ವೆಬ್ ಟಿಪ್ಪಣಿ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38427_2227165_2233197"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The edition of Windows 10 available through volume licensing, that is designed for education institutions, and includes all of the features of Windows 10 Pro, plus some other features like virtualization, management, DirectAccess, and BranchCache.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2227165">Windows 10 Education</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2233197">Windows 10 Education</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38428_2227166_2233198"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The edition of Windows 10 that is available only through volume licensing, is designed for businesses, and includes all of the features of Windows 10 Pro, plus some other features like virtualization, management, DirectAccess, and BranchCache.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2227166">Windows 10 Enterprise</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type