that can be applied to a sway.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2244481">Style gallery</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2253779">ಶೈಲಿ ಗ್ಯಾಲರಿ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38599_2244483_2253713"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The option that shows the set of fonts that can be applied to a sway.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2244483">Font choices</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2253713">ಫಾಂಟ್ ಆಯ್ಕೆಗಳು</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="386_93737_473864"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A hardware- or software-based interface used to transfer information between a computer and other devices. Hardware ports are physical connections that are visible on the outside of the computer. Software ports are the numbered gateways in programs that software programs use to exchange information.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="93737">port</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="473864">ಪೋರ್ಟ್</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNo