 for enterprises available to customers in April 2015 or later.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2254279">Windows 10 Enterprise Insider Preview</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2255946">Windows 10 Enterprise Insider Preview</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38691_2254280_2255948"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The prerelease build of Windows 10 made available to customers in April 2015 or later. This is the most basic edition of Windows 10 Insider Preview.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2254280">Windows 10 Home Insider Preview</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2255948">Windows 10 Home Insider Preview</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38694_2254283_2255950"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The prerelease build of Windows 10 for phones that was made available to Insiders.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2254283">Windows 10 Mobile Insider Preview</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2255950">Windows 10 Mobile Insider Preview</term><termNote type="geo