elected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39856_2357846_2321668"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Outlook feature that allows users to sort and display email based on predefined criteria.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2357846">Quick Filters for message list</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2321668">ತ್ವರಿತ ಫಿಲ್ಟರ್</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39856_2357846_2360097"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Outlook feature that allows users to sort and display email based on predefined criteria.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2357846">Quick Filters for message list</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2360097">ಸಂದೇಶ ಪಟ್ಟಿಗೆ ತ್ವರಿತ ಫಿಲ್ಟರ್‌ಗಳು</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39857_2312655_2427315"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Outlook feature that intelligently presorts email across all email accounts.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2312655">Focused Inbox</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2427315">ಕೇಂದ್ರೀಕೃತ ಇನ್‌ಬಾಕ್ಸ್</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39858_2312656_2427319"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The menu selection that allows users to move emails from the focused inbox into the Other category.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2312656">Move to Non-Focused Inbox</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2427319">ಕೇಂದ್ರೀಕೃತಗೊಳಿಸಿದ ಇನ್‌ಬಾಕ್ಸ್‌ಗೆ ಸರಿಸಿ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39864_2322624_2325373"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The wireless personal area network technology, launched in 2010 and marketed as Bluetooth Smart, used for transmitting data over distances as much as 100 meters. Cost and power consumption are low while maintaining a communication range similar to Bluetooth BR/EDR, the other widely-used version of Bluetooth</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2322624">Bluetooth Smart</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2325373">Bluetooth Smart</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39866_2315181_2319882"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Bluetooth Low Energy device that sends static information, such as location or ID, to devices within its area.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2315181">beacon</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2319882">ಬೀಕನ್</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3987_141789_1903030"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A placeholder text that included the field character, field type, and instructions, and that that shows where specified information from a data source will appear such that the elements in a field that generate a field's result.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="141789">field code</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1903030">ಕ್ಷೇತ್ರದ ಕೋಡ್</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39877_2315966_2319923"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature for maps of the interior of some public places, such as the businesses inside a mall, or the gates, businesses, and other services inside an airport.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2315966">venue map</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><te