e type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2377187">‌ರ‍್ಯಾಫ್ಟ್</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41930_2374257_2377188"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An item that is printed with a model to support and balance a model while it prints.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2374257">support</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2377188">ಬೆಂಬಲ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41931_2374260_2377924"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Zoom feature that allows users to create a pictorial table of contents containing a collection of their Section Zooms and that can update if the presentation is edited.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2374260">Summary Zoom</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2377924">ಸಾರಾಂಶ ಝೂಮ್</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41932_2374261_2377923"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Zoom feature that presents a preview of a slide in a presentation which auto-updates when the slide is updated and navigates users to that slide when they click on the preview</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2374261">Slide Zoom</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2377923">ಸ್ಲೈಡ್‌ ಝೂಮ್</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41933_2374264_2377922"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Zoom feature that presents a preview of a section in a presentation which auto-updates when the section’s first slide is updated, navigates users to that section when they click on the preview, and returns them back to the Summary Zoom when they are done.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2374264">Section Zoom</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2377922">ವಿಭಾಗೀಯ ಝೂಮ್</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41937_2374321_2377183"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A lock screen feature for mobile devices that lets users see their clock and lock screen info at a glance after your screen has turned off.​​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2374321">glance screen</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote 