Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41978_2375534_2377196"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The nickname for Windows 10, version 1607​, used by marketing and executives in announcements about this update, but not in the product.​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2375534">Windows 10 Anniversary Update</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2377196">Windows 10 ವಾರ್ಷಿಕೋತ್ಸವ ನವೀಕರಣ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41979_2375536_2739705"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The StaffHub tab where users are able to view all of the shifts their manager has them scheduled for.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2375536">My Shifts</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2739705">ನನ್ನ ಶಿಫ್ಟ್‌ಗಳು</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41981_2375539_2739732"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The StaffHub view that allows users to view the time they have requested off and the status of the time off requests.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2375539">Time off request</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2739732">ಟೈಮ್ ಆಫ್ ವಿನಂತಿ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41982_2375540_2739704"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The StaffHub tab that allows users to see and participate in chats with their co-workers as well as the team chat.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2375540">Messages</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2739704">ಸಂದೇಶಗಳು</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41983_2375541_2739727"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The StaffHub view that allows users to view and participate in a chat that is available to all their team members.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2375541">Team Chat</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2739727">ತಂಡದ ಚಾಟ್</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41984_2375542_2739693"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The StaffHub feature that allows users to search through a directory of their team members and add them to messages or chats.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2375542">Add people</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2739693">ಜನರ ಸೇರ್ಪಡೆ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41985_2375544_2739731"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The StaffHub view that allows users to view all the details of their time off, such as type of time off, time and date, and the reason for the time off.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2375544">Time off details</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2739731">ಟೈಮ್ ಆಫ್ ವಿವರಗಳು</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41986_2375545_2739730"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The StaffHub feature that allows users to view all the different types of time off they have scheduled.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2375545">Time off</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2739730">ಟೈಮ್ ಆಫ್</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41987_2375547_2739715"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The StaffHub view that allows users to view the details of their shift, such as the date and time of their shift, notes about the shift, and with whom they will be working.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2375547">Shift details</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2739715">ಶಿಫ್ಟ್ ವಿವರಗಳು</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41988_2375549_2739717"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The StaffHub feature that allows users to view what notes they have for a particular shift.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2375549">SHIFT NOTES</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2739717">ಶಿಫ್ಟ್ ಟಿಪ್ಪಣಿಗಳು</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41989_2375550_2377182"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An action performed on a Windows device that affects or is reflected on other devices associated with the same Microsoft account.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig