e or color. You can also use Paint to work with pictures, such as .jpg, .gif, or .bmp files.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2438784">Paint</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2441200">ಪೇಂಟ್</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43053_2439180_2441201"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A bar, appearing at the top, that displays a small preview image (thumbnail) of the content in each open tab.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2439180">preview bar</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2441201">ಪೂರ್ವವೀಕ್ಷಣೆ ಪಟ್ಟಿ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43054_2439181_2441203"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows you to see a small preview of the content in each open tab, shown in a persistent bar (not just on mouseover)​.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2439181">tab preview</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2441203">ಟ್ಯಾಬ್ ಪೂರ್ವವೀಕ್ಷಣೆ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">