ge, a set of common entities with built-in data models, security management, AI, and scalable integration. Its shared data storage provides single-source data consistency that customers can build apps, flows, bots, and AI models on, of varying complexity at scale.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2715882">CDS</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2450068">Common Data Service</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43056_2907430_2450068"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The low-code, back-end data platform that includes data storage, a set of common entities with built-in data models, security management, AI, and scalable integration. Its shared data storage provides single-source data consistency that customers can build apps, flows, bots, and AI models on, of varying complexity at scale.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2907430">Dataverse</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2450068">Common Data Service</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43059_2439287_2445001"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Office tool that erases a portion of an ink stroke up to where it intersects with itself or another ink stroke.</descrip><