ial media accounts, automatically upload them to OneDrive, and that shows any comments directly in PowerPoint.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2499542">Social Share</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2501674">Social Share</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44379_2499544_2501672"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app for Android that allows users to select links, text, and images, save it on their clipboard, and then put it somewhere universally accessible, such as Wunderlist, even from applications that don’t allow selection.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2499544">Clip Layer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2501672">Clip Layer</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44407_2500737_2699148"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The solution that provides a summary view of all ongoing user activities in Office 365 including SharePoint, Exchange, and Azure Active Directory.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2500737">Office 365 Analytics</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"