e, get, update, and delete a user’s tasks.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2514607">Tasks API</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2518244">ಕಾರ್ಯಗಳ API</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44666_2514608_2518243"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The API which surfaces functionality to manipulate and send messages, attachments, events, and folders.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2514608">Office 365 Mail API</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2518243">Office 365 ಮೇಲ್ API</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44668_2515502_2517896"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The setting (toggle) on account.microsoft.com/family that, when switched on, requires children to get adult permission for the things they buy in the Windows and Xbox stores — except for what they get with gift cards or money in their Microsoft account.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2515502">Ask a parent</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2517896">ಪೋಷಕರನ್ನು ಕೇಳಿ</term><termNote type="g