er Security Center, within Ransomware protection, where customers can set up or initiate file restores with cloud providers, to help recover from a ransomware attack (which often encrypts files).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2594920">Ransomware data recovery</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2597672">ರಾನ್ಸಮ್ವೇರ್ ಡೇಟಾ ಮರುಪ್ರಾಪ್ತಿ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46048_2594927_2597673"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In the Windows Defender Security Center, the area within the Virus &amp; threat protection section (pillar), where customers can find and use features to help prevent or recover from ransomware attacks.​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2594927">Ransomware protection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2597673">ರಾನ್ಸಮ್ವೇರ್ ಸಂರಕ್ಷಣೆ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46049_2594936_2597674"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In Windows Defender Security Center, the area within the Virus &amp; threat protection section (pillar) where customers can see the history of the threats found on their devices.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2594936">Threat history</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2597674">ಅಪಾಯದ ಇತಿಹಾಸ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46050_2594944_2597675"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In Windows Defender Security Center app on Windows 10, the area within the Virus &amp; threat protection section (pillar) where customers can see information about ​the definitions being used to recognize the latest threats on their device, and check for updates to those definitions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2594944">Virus &amp; threat protection updates</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2597675">ವೈರಸ್ ಮತ್ತು ಅಪಾಯ ಸಂರಕ್ಷಣೆ ಪರಿಷ್ಕರಣೆಗಳು</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46052_3029685_3029894"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app that allows users to make and receive calls and texts, check notifications, and instantly access their Android device's photos and apps from their Windows PC.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3029685">Phone Link</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3029894">ಫೋನ್ ಲಿಂಕ್</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><te