aticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46331_2609624_2611477"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The downloadable tool that runs a series of tests to diagnose and help fix problems with Surface hardware.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2609624">Surface Diagnostic Toolkit</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2611477">Surface ದೋಷನಿರ್ಣಯ ಟೂಲ್ಕಿಟ್</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46337_2609835_2786063"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To plan an event for a specific time slot.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2609835">schedule</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2786063">ನಿಗದಿಪಡಿಸಿ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46341_2610077_2611505"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The consumer-facing name for Hypervisor Code Integrity (HVCI). The HVCI service in Windows 10 determines whether code executing in kernel mode is securely designed and trustworthy, and helps ensure that all software running in kernel mode, including drivers, securely allocate memory and operate as they are intended.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2610077">memory integrity</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2611505">ಸ್ಮರಣೆ ಸಮಗ್ರತೆ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46344_2834959_2838058"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The desktop-only sync app for OneDrive that enables on-demand file sharing and navigation in File Explorer and that comes pre-installed on PCs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2834959">Microsoft OneDrive sync</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2838058">Microsoft OneDrive ಸಿಂಕ್ ಮಾಡು</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46344_2834959_2838063"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The desktop-only sync app for OneDrive that enables on-demand file sharing and navigation in File Explorer and that comes pre-installed on PCs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2834959">Microsoft OneDrive sync</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2838063">OneDrive ಸಿಂಕ್ ಮಾಡಿ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="gram