 management team with channels for each workload.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2816522">Advisor for Teams</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2818715">Teams ಗಾಗಿ ಸಲಹೆಗಾರ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49806_2816698_2818713"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature of Microsoft Teams that assesses the Office 365 tenant environment and identifies the most common configurations that may need to be updated or modified, and creates a Service management team with channels for each workload.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2816698">Advisor</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2818713">ಸಲಹೆಗಾರ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49806_2816698_2818715"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature of Microsoft Teams that assesses the Office 365 tenant environment and identifies the most common configurations that may need to be updated or modified, and creates a Service management team with channels for each workload.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2816698">Advisor</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2818715">Teams ಗಾಗಿ ಸಲಹೆಗಾರ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49808_2816676_2818738"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In Microsoft Teams, as part of Teams rollout done with Advisor for Teams, a workload is a set of features and settings that is used to deploy a specific collection of functions. Workloads are comprised of channels to complete the deployment of the functions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2816676">workload</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2818738">ವರ್ಕ್‌ಲೋಡ್</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49810_2816681_2818736"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To convert a phone number to a different format, by using a set of rules.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2816681">translate</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2818736">ಅನುವಾದಿಸು</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49811_2816684_2818726"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In the Microsoft 365 Admin Center, a specific network architecture design change that is recommended to improve user experience related to network connectivity to Office 365.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2816684">network insight</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2818726">ನೆಟ್‌ವರ್ಕ್ ಒಳನೋಟ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49812_2816685_2818728"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In the Microsoft 365 Admin Center, a score that shows how network connectivity impacts user experience allowing for comparison of different user location network connections.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2816685">network performance score</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2818728">ನೆಟ್‌ವರ್ಕ್ ಕಾರ್ಯನಿರ್ವಹಣೆ ಸ್ಕೋರ್</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49812_2816685_2818729"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In the Microsoft 365 Admin Center, a score that shows how network connectivity impacts user experience allowing for comparison of different user location network connections.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2816685">network performance score</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammatica