ue ID, process ID, process name, or a list of its controls.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2871540">WinGet</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2873018">WinGet</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50756_2873197_2873362"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The release channel for early adopters and developers in which client builds are available to the subscriber early in the development cycle with the newest code, which is typically weekly or bi-weekly.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2873197">Beta Channel</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2873362">ಬೀಟಾ ಚಾನಲ್</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50765_2873527_2873747"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Microsoft 365 subsite for SMBs that features resources to help them start, manage and grow their business.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2873527">Business Insights &amp; Ideas</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2873747">ವ್ಯವಹಾರ ಒಳನೋಟಗಳು ಮತ್ತು ಕಲ್ಪನೆಗಳು</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfS