 the users see on websites and social media will better reflect their interests.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2896246">social media cookie</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2897255">ಸಾಮಾಜಿಕ ಮಾಧ್ಯಮದ ಕುಕೀ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="51429_2897500_2897854"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To pin or lock an individual video feed for all attendees in a Teams meeting regardless of who is currently talking.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2897500">spotlight</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2897854">ಸ್ಪಾಟ್‌ಲೈಟ್</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="51447_2898061_2898112"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Xbox subscription service through which users can pay a monthly fee towards the purchase of an Xbox console plus Xbox Game Pass Ultimate.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2898061">Xbox All Access</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2898112">Xbox All Access</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><te