ies for fulling subject rights requests, also known as data subject requests.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3031830">Microsoft Priva Subject Rights Requests</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3029898">Priva ವಿಷಯ ಹಕ್ಕುಗಳ ವಿನಂತಿಗಳು</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53193_3031830_3032438"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The solution in the Microsoft 365 compliance center that includes automation and workflow capabilities for fulling subject rights requests, also known as data subject requests.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3031830">Microsoft Priva Subject Rights Requests</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3032438">Microsoft Priva ವಿಷಯ ಹಕ್ಕುಗಳ ವಿನಂತಿಗಳು</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53194_3030412_3030472"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A layout option for snapped windows.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3030412">snap layout</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3030472">ಸ್ನ್ಯಾಪ್ ಲೇಔಟ್</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partO