azardous locations.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3075969">HoloLens 2 Industrial Edition</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3076728">HoloLens 2 ಉದ್ಯಮ ಆವೃತ್ತಿ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53979_3075970_3076727"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The offer that combines HoloLens 2 with free trials of Unity software and Azure credits for cloud services to build collaborative, cross-platform mixed reality applications.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3075970">HoloLens 2 Development Edition</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3076727">HoloLens 2 ಡೆವಲಪ್‌ಮೆಂಟ್ ಆವೃತ್ತಿ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53980_3077237_3079215"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Pertaining to a limited form of free licensing that accompanies Microsoft 365 licenses and enables users to create and run canvas apps and flows with any of the standard “free” connectors.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3077237">seeded</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3079215">ಸೀಡೆಡ್<