ng users to inject faults into an executable without requiring rebuilding the binary or modifying the source code; thus, providing a means of simulating errors and testing recovery.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="329880">fault injection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="475022">ದೋಷ ಸೇರ್ಪಡಿಸುವಿಕೆ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6475_307228_1253171"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The heading for the last Mail Merge step, which allows the user to select how the merged publication or letters are produced.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="307228">Complete the merge</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1253171">ಜೋಡಿಸುವುದನ್ನು ಪೂರ್ಣಗೊಳಿಸು</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6477_413711_1903191"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A recording that is attached to your document.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="413711">voice comment</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1903191">ಧ್ವನಿ ಕಾಮೆಂಟ್</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6478_346951_475079"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of scenarios that lead to a desired outcome by a customer segment.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="346951">experience</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="475079">ಅನುಭವ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6479_397215_1956908"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A file that contains a record of the changes that were made to a database. All changes to the database are recorded in the transaction log files before they are written into the database files. If a database shuts down unexpectedly, unfinished transactions can be restored by replaying the transaction log files into the database.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="397215">transaction log file</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1956908">ವಹಿವಾಟು ಲಾಗ್ ಫೈಲ್</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="648_234820_474491"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A number that gives a general indication of the performance capability of your computer's hardware.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="234820">system rating</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="474491">ಸಿಸ್ಟಂ ರೇಟಿಂಗ್</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6484_136942_1937162"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A ready-made button that the user can insert into his/her presentation and define hyperlinks for.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="136942">action button</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1937162">ಕ್ರಿಯೆ ಬಟನ್</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6486_310254_474816"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An entity at one end of a point-to-point LAN/WLAN segment that is requesting authenticated access to the network.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="310254">supplicant</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="474816">ಮೊರೆ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6490_183384_2180845"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An agreement between two owners to promote content in different places.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="183384">affiliate marketing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2180845">ಸಂಯೋಜಿತ ಮಾರ್ಕೆಟಿಂಗ್</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6502_315144_474851"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A word, symbol, or other group of characters used to identify a file, a storage medium, an element defined in a computer program, or a specific item in a document such as a spreadsheet or a chart.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="315144">label</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="474851">ಲೇಬಲ್</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6507_130126_474039"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A series of measures to protect a machine from being infected by a virus.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="130126">virus protection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="474039">ವೈರಸ್ ರಕ್ಷಣೆ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6513_45147_473499"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Any piece of equipment that can be attached physically or wirelessly to a network or computer, for example, printers, keyboards, external disk drives, or other peripheral equipment.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="45147">device</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="473499">ಸಾಧನ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6514_397180_1956741"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Settings that are applied to the managed folders in users' mailboxes to control the retention and journaling of messages for messaging records management (MRM). Managed content settings define when messages that are no longer needed are to be removed or journaled (copied) to a separate storage location outside the mailbox.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="397180">managed content settings</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1956741">ನಿರ್ವಹಿಸಿದ ವಿಷಯ ಸೆಟ್ಟಿಂಗ್‌ಗಳು</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6516_50772_473563"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The process of turning data into a stream of bits. Encoding is part of the serialization process that converts data into a stream of ones and zeros.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="50772">encoding</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="473563">ಎನ್ಕೋಡಿಂಗ್</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6520_91124_473839"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An effect created by simple, repeating designs such as vertical or horizontal lines.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="91124">pattern</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="473839">ಮಾದರಿ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6533_62030_1250960"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A postal address at which a person is normally resident.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="62030">home address</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1250960">ಹೋಮ್ ವಿಳಾಸ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6533_62030_1308066"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A postal address at which a person is normally resident.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="62030">home address</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1308066">ಮನೆ ವಿಳಾಸ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6538_360134_475144"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A view that shows a graphical analysis of data in a datasheet or form. You can see different levels of detail or specify the layout by dragging fields and items or by showing and hiding items in the drop-down lists for the fields.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="360134">PivotChart view</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="475144">PivotChart ವೀಕ್ಷಣೆ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="6540_8001_473230"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Interactive or animated content used on the Internet. Active content includes ActiveX controls and web browser add-ons.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="8001">active content</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="473230">ಸಕ್ರಿಯ ವಿಷಯ<