computer. The administrator is responsible for installing software, assigning passwords, and managing files.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="318135">computer administrator</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1253199">ಆಡಳಿತಗಾರ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="8657_318135_1253200"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The person in charge of managing a computer. The administrator is responsible for installing software, assigning passwords, and managing files.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="318135">computer administrator</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1253200">ಗಣಕಯಂತ್ರ ಆಡಳಿತಗಾರ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="8657_318135_473246"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The person in charge of managing a computer. The administrator is responsible for installing software, assigning passwords, and managing files.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="318135">computer administrator</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="473246">ನಿರ್ವಾಹಕ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partO