er user from initiating a conversation and from viewing your presence or other information, such as your personal information.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="418607">block</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2290073">ನಿರ್ಬಂಧಿಸು</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="8757_558600_1956860"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The list of answers to a search request that match the search criteria specified by the user.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="558600">search results</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1956860">ಶೋಧ ಫಲಿತಾಂಶಗಳು</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="8769_9149_1956518"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The part of an agreement that defines the business process that is used, your role, your partner's role, and the policies or parameters that are used in that relationship along with documentation, such as a list of business and legal terms.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="9149">addendum</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1956518">ಅನುಬಂಧ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</ter