rawing window.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="237833">stencil</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1423552">ಸ್ಟೆನ್ಸಿಲ್</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9709_144267_1903050"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A fundamental data type that holds large integers. A Long variable is stored as a 32-bit number ranging in value from -2,147,483,648 to 2,147,483,647.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="144267">Long data type</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1903050">ದೀರ್ಘ ಡೇಟಾ ಪ್ರಕಾರ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9718_17587_1996583"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature in Internet Explorer that remembers the information you have typed into the Address bar, web forms, or password fields, and which automatically fills in that information if you start to type the same thing again later.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="17587">AutoComplete</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1996583">ಸ್ವಯಂಪೂರ್ಣಗೊಂಡ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9726_210054_2696041"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of reports or other data that is arranged in a panel format on a single page, or series of pages, in a web browser or SharePoint site.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="210054">dashboard</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2696041">ಡ್ಯಾಶ್‌ಬೋರ್ಡ್</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9733_1981778_2623575"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A pre-released version of a product that is sent to customers and partners for evaluation and feedback.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1981778">technical preview</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2623575">ತಾಂತ್ರಿಕ ಪೂರ್ವವೀಕ್ಷಣೆ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9733_694772_2623575"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A pre-released version of a product that is sent to customers and partners for evaluation and feedback.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="694772">beta product</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2623575">ತಾಂತ್ರಿಕ ಪೂರ್ವವೀಕ್ಷಣೆ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9734_42848_473482"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The manipulation of data to transform it into some desired result.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="42848">data processing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="473482">ಡೇಟಾ ಸಂಸ್ಕರಿಸುವಿಕೆ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9753_141881_1903031"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Text or graphics inserted in a document when Microsoft Word carries out a field's instructions. When you print the document or hide field codes, the field results replace the field codes.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="141881">field results</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1903031">ಕ್ಷೇತ್ರ ಫಲಿತಾಂಶಗಳು</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9767_319131_474947"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Pertaining to text that is aligned along the left margin.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="319131">left-aligned</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="474947">ಎಡ ಒಗ್ಗೂಡಿಸಿದ್ದು</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9775_142952_1903036"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A drop-down list box control on a data access page that retrieves records from an underlying recordset based on the value you select from the list. On a grouped page, the control retrieves a specific group of records.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="142952">group filter control</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1903036">ಸಮೂಹ ಫಿಲ್ಟರ್ ನಿಯಂತ್ರಣ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9789_158215_474251"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The company placing, and often paying for, a promotional message, or advertisement.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="158215">advertiser</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="474251">ಜಾಹಿರಾತುದಾರ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9800_30472_1319418"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In text-based computer graphics, a block of memory addresses that correspond to character spaces on a display screen. The memory allocated to each character space is used to hold the description of the character to be displayed in that space.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="30472">character map</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1319418">ಅಕ್ಷರ ನಕ್ಷೆ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9805_262641_474612"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A title animation in Windows Movie Maker.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="262641">Subtitle</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="474612">ಉಪಶೀರ್ಷಿಕೆ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9820_2727454_474747"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A directory or folder made available to users over the network.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2727454">file share</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="474747">ಹಂಚಿಕೆ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9820_298002_474747"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A directory or folder made available to users over the network.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="298002">share</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="474747">ಹಂಚಿಕೆ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9828_558613_2699730"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A person who takes part in an online interaction such as conference call or meeting.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="558613">participant</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2699730">ಪಾಲ್ಗೊಳ್ಳುವವರು</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9830_13827_2198339"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An activity represented by a time interval that has a start time, an end time, and a duration.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="13827">appointment</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2198339">ಗೊತ್ತುಪಡಿಸುವಿಕೆ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9831_235026_1253214"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The process of confirming that data passing into the system is correct and complies with predefined rules, definitions, or parameters.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="235026">validation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1253214">ದೃಢೀಕರಣ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9837_23010_473327"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The partition that contains the Windows operating system and its support files. The boot partition can be, but does not have to be, the same as the system partition.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="23010">boot partition</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="473327">ಬೂಟ್ ಕವಲು</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9839_503120_2198069"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A standardized service agreement between a user and a mobile operator that establishes data service details such as pricing, types of services, and bandwidth.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="503120">data plan</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2198069">ಡೇಟಾ ಯೋಜನೆ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9843_54256_2910545"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The use of computer files on networks, wherein files are stored on a central computer or a server and are requested, reviewed, and modified by more than one individual. When a file is used with different programs or different computers, file sharing can require conversion to a mutually acceptable format. When a single file is shared by many people, access can be regulated through such means as password protection, security clearances, or file locking to prohibit changes to a file by more than one person at a time.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="54256">file sharing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2910545">ಫೈಲ್ ಹಂಚಿಕೆ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9849_20127_473306"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In the printing and display of characters on the screen, an imaginary horizontal line with which the base of each character, excluding descenders, is aligned.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="20127">base line</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="473306">ಆಧಾರರೇಖೆ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9849_20128_473306"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In the printing and display of characters on the screen, an imaginary horizontal line with which the base of each character, excluding descenders, is aligned.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="20128">baseline</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="473306">ಆಧಾರರೇಖೆ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9856_307429_1956684"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The amount of time that can elapse before the Exchange server asks a mobile device running Exchange ActiveSync to connect again.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="307429">heartbeat interval</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1956684">ಹೃದಯಬಡಿತ ವಿರಾಮ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Other</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9865_145487_1250999"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A component database architecture that provides efficient network and Internet access to many types of data sources, including relational data, mail files, flat files, and spreadsheets. OLE DB comprises a specialized set of COM interfaces that expose data from a variety of data stores, both relational and nonrelational.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="145487">OLE DB</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1250999">OLEDB</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="9865_2072504_1250999"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A component database architecture that provides efficient network and Internet access to many types of data sources, including relational data, mail files, flat files, and spreadsheets. OLE DB comprises a specialized set of COM interfaces that expose data from a variety of data stores, both relational and nonrelational.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2072504">Object Linking and Embedding Database</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="kn"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1250999">OLEDB</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">IND</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="